  "description": "Two of COADM01C's declarations are never referenced again anywhere in the program and both survive the translation, because a declaration is part of what the program is. COPY CSUSR01Y at app/cbl/COADM01C.cbl:58 brings 01 SEC-USER-DATA into working storage and not one of its six fields is read or written; WS-USRSEC-FILE at line 39 holds the eight-byte logical file name 'USRSEC  ' - note the two trailing spaces of the source literal - and is likewise never referenced. This case runs an ordinary first-entry paint and asserts at the unit that the unused record is still blank afterwards, that the logical name is still its declared image, and that no SEC-USR value reaches the response. No dataset is seeded here, and deliberately so: the distinction from case16 is that this is working storage, not a file.",
